[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 663.11, "timestamp": "00:11:03", "text": "仪表更新，有个东西叫"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 665.269, "timestamp": "00:11:05", "text": "YO 扩展。所以一切都变成了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 667.75, "timestamp": "00:11:07", "text": "可集成的虚拟电缆之类的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 671.59, "timestamp": "00:11:11", "text": "事物。所以不再需要使用类似这样的用法了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 675.43, "timestamp": "00:11:15", "text": "这六根电缆。我可以直接把我的"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 681.269, "timestamp": "00:11:21", "text": "东西的意思呃 1 2 3 4 5 和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 686.47, "timestamp": "00:11:26", "text": "额外加上 1、2、3、4、5，所以总共有 10 个。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 690.069, "timestamp": "00:11:30", "text": "我可以使用五个输入和五个输出。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 692.15, "timestamp": "00:11:32", "text": "一。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 705.11, "timestamp": "00:11:45", "text": "但问题是，目前即使"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 707.829, "timestamp": "00:11:47", "text": "虽然你看我的麦克风在这里响了"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 711.269, "timestamp": "00:11:51", "text": "上面写着B2，这里还有。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 714.069, "timestamp": "00:11:54", "text": "还显示出一些信号之类的东西"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 719.43, "timestamp": "00:11:59", "text": "但实际上，它并没有发送出去。"}]